OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will clear away northeast this
OL,7,Fevening. Then the rest of the night
OL,8,Fwill see clear with a few showers in
OL,9,Fthe northwest, mainly dry in the east
OL,10,Fwith a touch of frost, some icy
OL,11,Fpatches.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAfter a dry start showery
OL,14,Frain, occasionally heavy, will spread
OL,15,Feast in the morning. Brighter with
OL,16,Fscattered showers in the afternoon.
OL,17,FBrisk southwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
