OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMild
OL,6,Fand windy on Monday with heavy rain in
OL,7,Fwest, drier in the east. Early rain
OL,8,Fthen bright with a few showers on
OL,9,FTuesday. Sunny spells and showers on
OL,10,FWednesday.
